%% Server life cycle (servers.status). Billing runs only inside server_usage periods.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending : POST /api/servers (row and IP in one tx)
  pending --> provisioning : linked (found by tag or created)
  pending --> pending : infra error means unknown, retry with lookup first
  pending --> failed : gave up after 8 attempts, IP released
  provisioning --> running : infra says running, usage period opens
  provisioning --> pending : 404, recreate
  pending --> terminating : terminate requested
  provisioning --> terminating : terminate requested
  running --> terminating : terminate requested, usage and IPs closed now
  terminating --> terminated : delete confirmed (OK, 404, or GET says gone)
  running --> terminated : reconciler found it vanished, billing stops
  terminated --> pending : restore within 24 h, old IP if free
  failed --> [*]
  terminated --> [*] : restore window passed, row kept
